## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design safe, minimal, observable feature flag gating in CNPA stacks under concurrency.

## Key Concepts

- Feature flags and per-request gating
- Centralized flag store vs per-instance cache
- TTL-based cache and cache invalidation
- Canary rollout and rollback criteria

## Code Example

```javascript
// Simple gate helper
const FLAG_KEY = 'beta_feature_enabled';
async function isBetaEnabled(redis, cache, ttl = 1000) {
  let v = cache.get(FLAG_KEY);
  if (typeof v !== 'boolean') {
    v = await redis.get(FLAG_KEY);
    cache.set(FLAG_KEY, v, ttl);
  }
  return Boolean(v);
}
```

